{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49943","headline":"赐新罗王 · 明皇帝","name":"赐新罗王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四维分景纬，万象含中枢。\n玉帛遍天下，梯杭归上都。\n缅怀阻青陆，岁月勤黄图。\n漫漫穷地际，苍苍连海隅。\n兴言名义国，岂谓山河殊。\n使去传风教，人来习典谟。\n衣冠知奉礼，忠信识尊儒。\n诚矣天其鉴，贤哉德不孤。\n拥旄同作牧，厚贶比生蒭。\n益重青青志，风霜恒不渝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}